# ==========================================
# 3D Models / Heavy Assets (Optional)
# ==========================================
# If your .glb files are massive (e.g., > 100MB), GitHub will reject them.
# You might want to track them using Git LFS (Large File Storage) instead.
# Uncomment the line below if you want to completely ignore 3D models.
# public/models/*.glb 

